  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Spell. Target foe and all nearby foes are struck with Searing Flames. Foes already on fire when this skill is cast are struck for 10...82...100 fire damage. Foes not already on fire begin Burning for 1...6...7 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "使目標及其附近的所有敵人受到爆裂火焰的影響。在這些敵人中，已經遭受「著火」病症的敵人受到 10～100 火焰傷害，而其餘敵人則遭受「著火」病症 1～7 秒。"
    },
